WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.150
It said done.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.950
It wasn’t.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.950
A line was off the page.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.450
Off by twenty-seven cents.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.950
So it refused.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.950
It rendered, measured, recomputed.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.950
Then it closed — with the evidence.
